    "id": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-98fc8b71b67b8cf3f3266d2b",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "属性断言：For H(s) = (24/z)*(s+z)/((s+4)(s+6)), the step response is y(t) = 1 + (12/z - 3)e^{-4t} + (2 - 12/z)e^{-6t}. When z=4 or z=6, one mode vanishes (pole-zero cancellation). The zero closest to the origin (z=1) produces the largest overshoot.",
